PCM03.PVI is the ADPCM bank named by fmp_test.ovi (driver slot 0, type PVI), from Modland (FM sound driver (FMP)/175/Digital Devil Story/PCM03.PVI), taken 2026-11-05 from https://modland.com/pub/modules/FM%20sound%20driver%20(FMP)/175/Digital%20Devil%20Story/PCM03.PVI. Modland states no licence; the samples belong to their author. Used unchanged, only as an fmp98-decode test fixture (rows I700, I1127). No PMD .PPC bank is shipped: Modland holds none, so the PMD path (pmd_test.m names no bank) is untested.
